#: input/pagecontent/actor-ochw.md:1
msgid "Description Health Wallet App linked to the National HIE that manages access to  patient summary information of a Pilgrim, particularly the IPS. The wallet app should manage consent profiles including time-bound access to an IPS, selective disclosure of content that is shared within the patient summary, and opt-out/opt-in on usage of the patient summary in a \"break the glass\" scenario.   Transactions participated in as source The health wallet initiates the following transactions:  record consent from wallet - request (record-consent-request) issue VHL request (issue-vhl-request)"
